# Proposed per-root algorithm; process account is shared by every job/instance.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Valid authorized search\nAtomic worker + (roots + 2) descriptor credits" {class: start}
Refuse: "Busy admission / latched disabled cohort\nCAPACITY_LIMIT; no new inspections\nIndefinite cohort block → process restart"
Cycle: "Cyclic root turn\n64 entries / 32 transitions maximum"
Check: "Before every listing turn / read\nRecheck current path / identity / policy\nMovement or uncertainty → one root remainder"
Stream: "One current stream for this root\nClassify next name; metadata in bounded scratch"
Anchor: "Matchable ordinary directory?\nDepth below 32 and queue room?"
Depth: "Depth 32 → DEPTH_LIMIT root group\nName remains matchable; no descent"
Frontier: "512 tasks / 384 KiB full → FRONTIER_LIMIT\nName remains matchable; continue siblings"
Queue: "Append path / target + parent identities\nFIFO; no eviction / retry / sibling array"
EOF: "EOF → close current stream\nDequeue oldest pending directory"
Done: "Queue empty → root finished\nCOMPLETE only without affecting omissions"
Walk: "Fresh checked no-follow component walk\nTwo temporary credits; pre-open parent checks\nPrefix / parent change → one root remainder\nTarget-only change under stable parent → SUBTREE\nRepeated prefix walks spend shared wait"
Stop: "Freeze once: stream tail / queue → REMAINDER\nCommitted depth / frontier groups survive\nWorker alone cleans up after blocked return"
Limits: "Shared process account\nS = min(72, max(0, soft limit − 128))\nAt most 18 owned credits / job\nPlatform / unrelated demand uses remaining table\nNative path / opaque resource design open\nInstrument transient opens / accept backoff\nProducer reviews precede planning"
Start -> Refuse: "1 · atomic admission fails"
Start -> Cycle: "1 · all job credits reserved"
Start -> Limits: "1 · shared ledger, not a private table"
Cycle -> Check: "2 · admitted root"
Check -> Stream: "3 · established unchanged"
Check -> Stop: "3 · changed / uncertain"
Stream -> Anchor: "3 · observed name"
Anchor -> Depth: "4 · depth check precedes frontier"
Anchor -> Frontier: "4 · queue count / bytes"
Anchor -> Queue: "4 · descent fits"
Anchor -> Cycle: "4 · file / intrinsic / policy outcome"
Depth -> Cycle: "5 · next turn / name"
Frontier -> Cycle: "5 · next turn / name"
Queue -> Cycle: "5 · next turn / name"
Stream -> EOF: "3 · listing ends"
EOF -> Walk: "4 · pending task"
EOF -> Done: "4 · no pending task"
Walk -> Cycle: "5 · new listing / diagnosed refusal"
Cycle -> Stop: "2 · wait / work / failure stop"
